{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121813","id":4139085811,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc72tW_z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121813","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121813.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121813.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121813","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121813/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121813/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121813/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d759034c12e2028ca07ae7ab3f60314be885ed2c","number":121813,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Android editor: Addition Virtual Keyboard suppress button in the Touch Action Panel!","user":{"login":"GDevSh007","id":247660653,"node_id":"U_kgDODsMAbQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/247660653?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007","html_url":"https://github.com/GDevSh007","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\r\nIt introduces a dedicated Virtual Keyboard disable button for the Android Editor under in the Touch Action Panel!\r\n\r\nWhat problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nWorking on small device screens like phones can become a hurdle when the Virtual Keyboard pops up after every accidental tap on an input field, especially within the script editor. A dedicated button to suppress the keyboard provides a much smoother workflow when text input isn't immediately needed.\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a960cdbf-9876-4ff3-867b-26fefecb2b0e\r\n\r\nAfter: \r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3bcfc00f-2e74-492f-b224-e48c9c6ce8d1\r\n\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n​Note on Editor Updates: I recognize that the introduction of touch support for TextEdit and CodeEdit in 4.8 dev1 already solves a massive hurdle for the Script Editor environment on touch displays. However, this global suppression toggle remains useful for other edge cases and subjective user workflows!\r\n​Note on AI: AI tools were utilized to help locate the relevant C++ engine areas (like display_server_android.cpp) and generate boilerplate code snippets for this implementation.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/